sclaimer</a></li><li><a class=\"block py-2 text-sm text-slate-200 hover:text-purple-400 transition-colors duration-200\" href=\"/affiliate-disclosure\">Affiliate Disclosure</a></li></ul></nav></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-2\"><h2 class=\"text-white font-bold text-base mb-4 flex items-center gap-2\">Stay Connected</h2><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-white bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 px-4 py-3 rounded-lg transition-all duration-200 border border-slate-700 hover:border-slate-600 w-full justify-center mb-6\" href=\"/contact-us\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7\"></path><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg><span class=\"font-semibold\">Email Our Team</span></a><div class=\"hidden lg:block pt-2\"><h3 class=\"text-white font-semibold text-sm mb-3\">Follow Us</h3><div class=\"flex gap-3\"><a aria-label=\"Follow on Facebook\" class=\"h-10 w-10 flex items-center justify-center bg-slate-800 text-slate-100 rounded-lg hover:bg-[#1877F2] hover:text-white hover:scale-110 transition-all duration-200\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/TopTenUAEofficial\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-facebook w-5 h-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 2h-3a5 5 0 0 0-5 5v3H7v4h3v8h4v-8h3l1-4h-4V7a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h3z\"></path></svg></a><a aria-label=\"Follow on X (Twitter)\" class=\"h-10 w-10 flex items-center justify-center bg-slate-800 text-slate-100 rounded-lg hover:bg-black hover:text-white hover:scale-110 transition-all duration-200\" href=\"https://x.com/top10_uae\"><svg xmlns=\"