0 rounded-xl shadow-sm hover:border-purple-200 transition-colors\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-purple-50 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-purple-600 flex-shrink-0 mr-4 mt-1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-5 h-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></div><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\">Address</p><p class=\"font-bold text-gray-900 text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap leading-relaxed\">Nad Al Sheba 3, \nPO Box 300331, \nDubai, UAE.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-6 p-5 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-200\"><h4 class=\"text-sm font-black text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2 flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-info w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg> Why Selected</h4><p class=\"text-slate-800 font-semibold leading-relaxed\">Best for discipline and traditional boarding school values.</p></div><div class=\"mb-8 p-5 bg-rose-50 rounded-xl border border-rose-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert w-5 h-5 text-rose-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"font-black text-rose-900 text-sm uppercase tracking-widest\">The Reality Check</h3></div><ul class=\"space-y-2.5\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-gray-800 leading-snug font-medium\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-rose-500 rounded-full flex-shrink-0\"></span><span>Location is far from Marina/JLT areas.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-gray-800 leading-snug font-medium\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-rose-500 rounded-full flex-shrink-0\"></span><span>Academic and behavioral rigor is high; not for &quot;free spirits.&quot;</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-gray-800 leading-snug font-medium\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-rose-500 rounded-full flex-shrink-0\"></span><span>Very traditional British ethos might feel stiff to some.</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"pt-6 border-t border-gray-100 flex justify-center md:justify-start\"><a href=\"https://www.reptondubai.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 gap-2 text-base font-bold text-white bg-[#2563EB] hover:bg-blue-700 rounded-xl transition-all shadow-md hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-0.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-globe w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h20\"></path></svg> Visit Official Website <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide luc