ic pools). Blends US flexibility with IB Diploma rigor.\\\",\\\"website\\\":\\\"https://www.gemsaa-dubai.com\\\"},\\\"rank\\\":3,\\\"whySelected\\\":\\\"Best facilities and broadest subject choices.\\\"},{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"de92fe0a5549\\\",\\\"badgeLabel\\\":\\\"Best Primary School\\\",\\\"customVerdict\\\":null,\\\"product\\\":{\\\"_type\\\":\\\"institution\\\",\\\"address\\\":\\\"26th Street, \\\\nUmm Suqeim 3,\\\\nPO Box 38199, \\\\nDubai, UAE.\\\",\\\"affiliateLink\\\":null,\\\"availability\\\":null,\\\"brand\\\":null,\\\"code\\\":null,\\\"cons\\\":null,\\\"country\\\":null,\\\"currency\\\":null,\\\"curriculum\\\":\\\"British\\\",\\\"customerRating\\\":null,\\\"entityType\\\":null,\\\"feeRange\\\":\\\"AED 47,179 – AED 71,801\\\",\\\"heroFeature\\\":null,\\\"keyFeatures\\\":null,\\\"location\\\":\\\"Umm Suqeim 3\\\",\\\"mainImage\\\":{\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Kings' School Dubai playground and primary classrooms.\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/2a0db614772fbf3c5d00fc65369245da2c6a0e4e-1200x675.webp\\\"},\\\"price\\\":null,\\\"priceTier\\\":null,\\\"pros\\\":null,\\\"rating\\\":\\\"Outstanding\\\",\\\"realityCheck\\\":[\\\"Primary only: You must move schools after Year 6 (usually to Kings' Al Barsha).\\\",\\\"Parking is difficult; Umm Suqeim residential streets gridlock at 2:30 PM.\\\",\\\"Fees are high for a primary-only education.\\\"],\\\"retailer\\\":null,\\\"reviewCount\\\":null,\\\"slug\\\":\\\"kings-school-dubai\\\",\\\"specifications\\\":null,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Kings' School Dubai\\\",\\\"verdict\\\":\\\"The only school to maintain an 'Outstanding' rating every year since inspections began. A nurturing Primary-only campus (FS1 to Year 6).\\\",\\\"website\\\":\\\"https://kings-edu.com/dubai\\\"},\\\"rank\\\":4,\\\"whySelected\\\":\\\"Best for a gentle, nurturing start to education.\\\"},{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"8ee458f0b7c8\\\",\\\"badgeLabel\\\":\\\"The IB Specialist\\\",\\\"customVerdict\\\":null,\\\"product\\\":{\\\"_type\\\":\\\"insti